        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Glycerine, from epichlorohydrin, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Glycerine, from epichlorohydrin, at plant
Glycerine is produced by reacting epichlorohydrin with a 10% sodium hydroxide aqueous solution;
CAS number: 000056-81-5; 
Formula: C3H8O3; 
UUID: 65968bec-b0a8-3330-9852-dd11a8aff98e
cradle-to-gate, including all precursors, ancillary materials and transports
Location: RER
Technology: based on industry data in the US and Europe
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_65968bec-b0a8-3330-9852-dd11a8aff98e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
